      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think this could work really well if worlds are tagged as `CE - Cosmetics Only` where there are only cosmetic rewards (e.g. the golden gun in Jar's Murder games) or `CE - Exclusive Content` where content is gated behind a subscription (such as VIP rooms or other pay-to-win benefits).\n\nI'm not sure if the tags should be mutually exclusive, but being able to filter worlds by these tags would be a nice thing to have as well.",
